{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12739","headline":"酬李书记校书越城秋夜见赠 · 张继","name":"酬李书记校书越城秋夜见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东越秋城夜，西人白发年。\n寒城警刁斗，孤愤抱龙泉。\n凤辇栖岐下，鲸波鬬洛川。\n量空海陵粟，赐乏水衡钱。\n投阁嗤扬子，飞书代鲁连。\n苍苍不可问，余亦赋思玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}